{"version":1,"key":"card:618","content":{"id":618,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7bd8d1fa-a0fe-4fed-bf65-6c9c6ff272c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":":focus"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 伪类选择器选中当前获得焦点的元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"44e4fc19-8ce7-41a7-ac99-786087cce21c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"40b8cf58-3451-4c64-8ce6-dd2bc831c6ef","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<style>\n    #input {\n        width: 300px;\n        height: 48px;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        outline: 2px solid rgb(255, 255, 255, 10%);\n      \toutline-offset: -2px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n      \tmargin: 0 auto;\n      \tfont-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    #input:focus {\n        outline-color: #ffd061;\n    }\n</style>\n<input id=\"input\" placeholder=\"Input Here\" />","collabId":"0d92fa19-72f4-40a7-abba-eaa621aec0ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<style>\n    [data-theme=\"light\"] #input1 {\n      outline-color: rgb(0, 0, 0, 10%)\n    }\n    #input1 {\n        background: #302F33;\n        width: 300px;\n        height: 48px;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        outline: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 10%);\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n      \tcolor: #fff;\n      \toutline-offset: -2px;\n      \tmargin: 0 auto;\n      \ttransition: outline-color 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    #input1:focus {\n        outline-color: #ffd061!important;\n    }\n</style>\n<input id=\"input1\" placeholder=\"Input Here\" />","collabId":"3371a3ee-7aa8-4bc5-853f-b8cb04da9222","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a61b0bc-3c52-4eaa-8c12-2e02053b8add","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"出于某些目的，我们希望给可聚焦的元素会添加一些容器，比如要显示自定义的错误，此时会将这个容器当作是一个可聚焦的元素，当内部实际的可聚焦的元素聚焦时，外部的容器能够表现出特殊的样式，在无特殊选择器的情况下，需要使用 JavaScript 监听内部可聚焦元素的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"focus"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blur"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，然后给外部容器添加不同的类来显示不同的效果。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"effff38b-7b69-4214-936b-f8b92d672616","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在可以直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":":focus-within"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选择器来实现这一目的。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":":focus-within"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选择器会选中当元素自身聚焦或者子孙元素聚焦的元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"24dce6a7-942c-4f89-a663-2659f3c4553f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"41c54860-dfe1-49e8-aa8d-488281df4353","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<style>\n    #input-container {\n        width: 300px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        background: #302F33;\n        height: 48px;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        outline: 2px solid #E95C3D;\n        outline-offset: -2px;\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        color: #fff;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    #input-container:focus-within {\n      outline-color: #ffd061;\n    }\n    #input {\n        min-width: 0;\n        flex: 1;\n        background: transparent;\n        outline: none;\n        border: none;\n 